 "_comment": "Outdoor Research sweep 2026-11-09: the Foray 3L Rain Pants asked for, plus the trail-relevant current OR line missing from the catalog (rain shells, down and synthetic insulation, wind shells, fleece, base layers, sun hats and gloves, the Alpine XT bivy). Every weight is the maker's own spec line ('Weight: X oz/ Y g') on its product page, which names no size, so apparel rows say Men's or Women's with size unpublished. Each was cross-checked against the per-variant weights in OR's store data. Dropped: Men's Ferrosi Convertible Pant and Men's Versaliner Sensor Glove, whose spec line reads '19.36 oz/ 549 g', a figure OR's store data carries as a placeholder on unrelated products; Men's Ferrosi Short 7in (336 g against the women's 150 g, and no other source for the 7in); Women's Stratoburst Stretch Rain Jacket, printed at the men's exact 8.47 oz/ 240 g, which reads as a copied spec. Left out on purpose: tactical, ski, bike, casual and kids' lines, packs and duffels.",
